      <activity id="d75df67a-3671-54ae-b3c9-cb3ab3e09e21" activityNameId="89d1232b-1fd0-5641-91bf-9a32ea625612" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mine, gold</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mine, gold
This data set includes land use of the considered mines (open pit and underground) incl. revegetated areas as well as estimates of buildings and machinery of the mine based on the data set non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground.;
UUID: 852b7fea-c76b-3bd9-9580-ab4ecc0c397e
Land use, buildings and machinery of mining
Location: Land use of Australian mine, other inputs based on rough assumptions.
Technology: Assumptions for buildings and machinery based on the data set "non-ferrous metal, mine, surface/underground with 50 years life time.
Time period: Period of public environmental report
Production volume: 118.5 Mill. t ore
Sampling: environmental report 
Extrapolations: Buildings and machinery are based on global assumptions. The figures are extrapolated on the basis of the ore production.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_852b7fea-c76b-3bd9-9580-ab4ecc0c397e.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
